    {
      "section_no": null,
      "section_title": null,
      "chunk_type": "worked_example",
      "content_markdown": "সমাধান : প্রদত্ত সমীকরণ\n$x+2y=9$.........(1)\n$2x-y=3$.........(2)",
      "activity_tag": null
    },
    {
      "section_no": null,
      "section_title": null,
      "chunk_type": "worked_example",
      "content_markdown": "সমীকরণ (2) হতে পাই, $y = 2x - 3$.........(3)",
      "activity_tag": null
    },
    {
      "section_no": null,
      "section_title": null,
      "chunk_type": "worked_example",
      "content_markdown": "সমীকরণ (1) এ $y$ এর মান বসিয়ে পাই, $x + 2(2x - 3) = 9$\nবা, $x+4x-6=9$\nবা, $5x = 6+9$\nবা, $5x = 15$\nবা, $x = \\frac{15}{5}$\n$\\therefore x=3$",
      "activity_tag": null
    },
    {
      "section_no": null,
      "section_title": null,
      "chunk_type": "worked_example",
      "content_markdown": "এখন $x$ এর মান সমীকরণ (3) -এ বসিয়ে পাই,\n$y=2\\times3-3$\n$=6-3$\n$=3$",
      "activity_tag": null
    },
